\subsection{Ablation Studies}

We will isolate the contribution of the perspective penalty, the relaxed
symbol-count term, and the gradient acting on learned step sizes. All variants
will share the ResNet--18 checkpoint and training budget. The principal
ablation, shown in Table~\ref{tab:ablation}, separates ordinary LSQ from the
complete method. Additional studies will vary $T_1,T_2,T_3$, the number of dual
iterations, and the frequency of the entropy update. The expected conclusion
