compression result retained for the final comparison. Each column must refer
to one specific run: when a better run replaces the current best result, its
entire column must be updated from the corresponding log rather than combining
values from different experiments. The ResNet--18 column is populated from the
completed run underlying the preliminary result in
Section~\ref{sec:preliminary-cross-architecture-results}; the remaining columns will be completed when the
corresponding experiments become available.
\end{comment}

